cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A Microsimulation of Age-Out Dynamics in United States Employment-Based Immigration"
message: >-
  If you use this microsimulation, its shipped outputs, or this code, please
  cite the accompanying SSRN preprint (see preferred-citation). To cite the
  software specifically, use the metadata in this file. If the article is
  published in the International Journal of Microsimulation, please cite the
  published version instead.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Adhithiya Narayanan
    family-names: Balamurugan
